<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 6,359 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,600 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  143   (152 and 187)</p>
<p>    Good		122   (122 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     115   (114 and 120)</p>
<p>    Medium	    105   (104 and 105)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 88   ( 88 and  90)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 143 pence for a Ceylon BOPF</p>
</text>
